1
00:00:01,015 --> 00:00:09,821
Bangladesh: ~80% of court cases are land disputes. One plot can be sold twice, and deed and khatian drift apart.

2
00:00:09,821 --> 00:00:16,095
LandShield BD: Scan → Verify → Detect → Mutate → Citizen check. All data here is synthetic (demo).

3
00:00:16,095 --> 00:00:19,672
An officer uploads a sale deed: Doc1, Rahim sells plot LP-10234 to Karim.

4
00:00:19,672 --> 00:00:30,794
OCR + field extraction: each field gets a confidence score; a human reviews before anything is saved.

5
00:00:30,794 --> 00:00:37,706
Approve: the deed is hashed, Ed25519-signed and added to a hash-chained ledger. e-Mutation starts automatically.

6
00:00:37,706 --> 00:00:43,911
e-Mutation queue: Doc1 passed all six pre-checks → fast track (Under review).

7
00:00:43,911 --> 00:00:52,164
Doc2: the same seller sells the same plot again, this time to Hasan.

8
00:00:52,164 --> 00:01:01,924
Possible double sale → HIGH 70, with the evidence for every indicator. An indicator for review, not a legal finding.

9
00:01:01,924 --> 00:01:08,668
Doc2's mutation failed the pre-checks, so it goes to a hearing instead of the fast track.

10
00:01:08,668 --> 00:01:18,245
Ownership graph: one seller linked to two buyers of the same plot.

11
00:01:18,245 --> 00:01:19,179
Check Before You Buy: a buyer checks plot LP-10900 before paying.

12
00:01:19,179 --> 00:01:28,962
Plain-language checklist: this plot is recorded as khas (government) land → consult the AC Land office.

13
00:01:28,962 --> 00:01:30,044
Verify a copy: someone changed the land area on a copy of Doc1.

14
00:01:30,044 --> 00:01:37,281
ALTERED: the copy does not match the signed record (land area).

15
00:01:37,281 --> 00:01:40,460
Every approved record is chained with SHA-256 in a ledger.

16
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:43,078
Now someone edits the database directly, bypassing the app…

17
00:01:43,078 --> 00:01:50,187
…and the hash-chained ledger exposes it: chain BROKEN at the edited entry.

18
00:01:50,187 --> 00:01:54,867
Original value restored → INTACT.

19
00:01:54,867 --> 00:02:02,718
Full Bangla interface · সম্পূর্ণ বাংলা ইন্টারফেস

20
00:02:02,718 --> 00:02:09,482
QR public page: a signed summary with no personal data.

21
00:02:09,482 --> 00:02:16,719
Land records should be searchable, connected, verifiable and risk-aware. LandShield BD · Team DEEDGUARD
